<title>USA: ITEX Corp Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>ITEX Corp Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>	     Third Qtr    Third Qtr  Year-to-Date  Year-to-Date</p>
<p>	   May 7, 1997   Apr 9, 1996   May 7, 1997  Apr 9, 1996</p>
<p> Revenue	   $6,479	 $6,437	 $17,789    $22,429</p>
<p>Income from</p>
<p>  Operations	1,641	    791	   3,785	1,787</p>
<p> Net Income	 2,017	    746	   3,328	2,381</p>
<p>Income per</p>
<p>   Share	     0.22	   0.09	    0.40	 0.32</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1997 revs from its trade exchange business decreased to $4,166,000 from $5,275,000 in the third quarter of 1996, but gross margin from trade exchange operations showed only a small decrease from $2,484,000 in the third quarter 1996 to $2,239,000 in the quarter just ended.</p>
</text>
